                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": {
                      "blocks": {
                        "contentData": [],
                        "settingsData": [],
                        "expose": [],
                        "Layout": {}
                      },
                      "markup": "\u003Cp\u003E\u0026ldquo;I\u0026rsquo;ve had the great honour of being a school counsellor here at Santiago High School for the past 20 years.\u0026rdquo; Santiago is especially meaningful to Ms. Montes, who is herself a graduate of the school (Class of 1996).\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAreas of responsibility:\u003C/strong\u003E Department Chair, Master Schedule, 9\u0026ndash;12 registration, College Signing Day, special student programs, the Senior Survey, and College \u0026amp; Career instruction for 11th graders.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EStudents and families are welcome to email her or visit the Counselling Office with any questions or concerns.\u003C/p\u003E"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "alias": "blockVisibility",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": "1"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "contentTypeKey": "9f661a13-f119-496b-b746-26b09b3f2a03",
                "key": "b28bf7aa-917a-417f-ac05-e9a07ca463ab",
                "values": [
                  {
                    "alias": "photo",
                    "culture": null,
                    "editorAlias": null,
                    "segment": null,
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "key": "b1c05e10-0001-4001-9001-000000000003",
